# Rider Execution Portal & Real-Time Tracking

This plan outlines the architecture and tasks required to build the mobile-first Rider Portal, integrating role-based gateways, a batched jobs board, active routing, secure OTP handshake, and realtime GPS tracking via Socket.io.

## User Review Required

> [!WARNING]
> Please review the new API routes and the proposed frontend URL structure (`/rider/jobs`, `/rider/active`). Let me know if you have different design preferences for the Rider Bottom Navigation items!

## Proposed Changes

---

### Backend (`server/routes/`)

#### [MODIFY] [orders.js](file:///c:/Users/karan/OneDrive/Desktop/Delivery-Partner/server/routes/orders.js)
- **Add** `GET /api/orders/batches/available`: Fetch orders where `status: 'pending'` and `batchId` exists, aggregating them to show total distance, earnings, and stops.
- **Add** `POST /api/orders/verify-otp`: Secure OTP handshake. Validates the provided OTP for a specific order and changes its status (to `picked_up` or `delivered`), emitting `order:statusChanged` via Socket.io.

#### [MODIFY] [riders.js](file:///c:/Users/karan/OneDrive/Desktop/Delivery-Partner/server/routes/riders.js)
- **Add** `PATCH /api/riders/accept-batch`: Associates a batch of orders to the logged-in rider. Updates `Rider.activeOrders`, changes order statuses to `assigned`, and emits `order:assigned` to merchants.

---

### Frontend (`client/`)

#### [MODIFY] [App.jsx](file:///c:/Users/karan/OneDrive/Desktop/Delivery-Partner/client/src/App.jsx)
- **Add** Role-based redirection logic: if `user.role === 'rider'`, navigate to `/rider/jobs`.
- **Add** `<Route>` wrappers for Rider Protected Routes.

#### [NEW] [RiderLayout.jsx](file:///c:/Users/karan/OneDrive/Desktop/Delivery-Partner/client/src/rider/RiderLayout.jsx)
- A mobile-first layout hiding standard sidebars.
- Exclusively uses a sticky bottom navigation bar with icons for: Jobs, Active Batch, Profile, and Earnings.

#### [NEW] [JobsBoard.jsx](file:///c:/Users/karan/OneDrive/Desktop/Delivery-Partner/client/src/rider/JobsBoard.jsx)
- Fetches and displays available batches.
- Subcomponent: **JobCard** mapping total distance, earnings, stop details.
- Action: "Accept Batch" hitting the backend API. Touch-friendly UI.

#### [NEW] [ActiveRoute.jsx](file:///c:/Users/karan/OneDrive/Desktop/Delivery-Partner/client/src/rider/ActiveRoute.jsx)
- Maps the active batch into a step-by-step sequence (Pickup A -> Pickup B -> Drop A).
- Displays 'Open in Maps' (deep linking via `google.com/maps`).
- Action: "Verify Stop" button which invokes an OTP Keypad Dialog.

#### [NEW] [useRiderLocation.js](file:///c:/Users/karan/OneDrive/Desktop/Delivery-Partner/client/src/hooks/useRiderLocation.js)
- React hook subscribing to `navigator.geolocation.watchPosition()`.
- Emits Socket.io event (`rider:locationUpdate`) containing `riderId`, `lat`, `lng`, and `activeBatchId` every 10 seconds.
- Connects rider to specific socket rooms per `batchId`.

